<item><title>Botswana seeks P4.7 billion from investors in debt auction on November 27</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/botswana-seeks-p4-7-billion-from-investors-in-debt-auction-718e74/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bw/botswana-seeks-p4-7-billion-from-investors-in-debt-auction-718e74/</guid><category>Botswana</category><description>The sale is a test of how much domestic appetite remains for the government&apos;s debt, with three-quarters of the money maturing within six months.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 06:46:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bw.jpg" length="34363" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
